  "notes": [
    {
      "row": "notes",
      "title": "How much of this file is not in this checkpoint",
      "text": "modeling_gemma4.py carries an audio tower, a MoE block, KV sharing, a double-wide MLP and the Gemma-3n per-layer-input path. The 31B-it config switches all of them off. Reading the class list and assuming it describes the model is the easiest mistake to make here.",
      "code": [
        {
          "role": "definition",
